# "Whenever a player casts their second spell each turn": any player's, its controller's included, and the target is an
# opponent of the Battler's controller, so Bot1's own second spell on turn 3 (Mox Sapphire, then Mox Emerald) costs Bot2 2
# life, not Bot1. The first spell of the turn does nothing, and neither does the Battler's own cast on turn 1.

